[{"id":"kana-2-75-5","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bio je","en":"he/it was"},{"bs":"zaista će biti","en":"surely they will be"},{"bs":"bila je","en":"she/it was"},{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"}],"ref":"2:75","answerWord":"كَانَ","answerSound":"audio/7180c0f15dc5ef236d7b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have ye any hope that they will be true to you when a party of them used to listen to the word of Allah, then used to change it, after they had understood it, knowingly?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["أَفَتَطْمَعُونَ","أَن","يُؤْمِنُوا۟","لَكُمْ","وَقَدْ","كَانَ","فَرِيقٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","يَسْمَعُونَ","كَلَٰمَ","ٱللَّهِ","ثُمَّ","يُحَرِّفُونَهُۥ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","عَقَلُوهُ","وَهُمْ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-15-93-1","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bili su (činili)","en":"they were (used to)"},{"bs":"budi!","en":"be!"},{"bs":"bit će","en":"he/it will be"},{"bs":"budu","en":"they are"}],"ref":"15:93","answerWord":"كَانُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2f94ca38a262379d59ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Of what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["عَمَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-23-1","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bili ste","en":"you (all) were"},{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"},{"bs":"budu","en":"they (two) are"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"}],"ref":"2:23","answerWord":"كُنتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/15b41e1088715acba899.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if ye are in doubt concerning that which We reveal unto Our slave (Muhammad), then produce a surah of the like thereof, and call your witness beside Allah if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَإِن","كُنتُمْ","فِى","رَيْبٍ","مِّمَّا","نَزَّلْنَا","عَلَىٰ","عَبْدِنَا","فَأْتُوا۟","بِسُورَةٍ","مِّن","مِّثْلِهِۦ","وَٱدْعُوا۟","شُهَدَآءَكُم","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[1,18],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-34-10","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"i bio je","en":"and he/it was"},{"bs":"bila je","en":"she/it was"},{"bs":"i budemo","en":"and we are"},{"bs":"i da bude","en":"and so that he/it may be"}],"ref":"2:34","answerWord":"وَكَانَ","answerSound":"audio/32005dafe5365ce73bdf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We said unto the angels: Prostrate yourselves before Adam, they fell prostrate, all save Iblis. He demurred through pride, and so became a disbeliever.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","ٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِءَادَمَ","فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","إِبْلِيسَ","أَبَىٰ","وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","وَكَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-4-97-10","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bili smo","en":"we were"},{"bs":"budemo","en":"we are"},{"bs":"da budu","en":"so that they (two) may be"},{"bs":"bio sam","en":"I was"}],"ref":"4:97","answerWord":"كُنَّا","answerSound":"audio/edb475d3958274b94a1b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! as for those whom the angels take (in death) while they wrong themselves, (the angels) will ask: In what were ye engaged? They will say: We were oppressed in the land. (The angels) will say: Was not Allah's earth spacious that ye could have migrated therein? As for such, their habitation will be hell, an evil journey's end;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","تَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","ظَالِمِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","فِيمَ","كُنتُمْ","قَالُوا۟","كُنَّا","مُسْتَضْعَفِينَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَلَمْ","تَكُنْ","أَرْضُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٰسِعَةً","فَتُهَاجِرُوا۟","فِيهَا","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَأْوَىٰهُمْ","جَهَنَّمُ","وَسَآءَتْ","مَصِيرًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-91-28","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bili ste","en":"you (all) were"},{"bs":"i da bude","en":"and so that he/it may be"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo biti","en":"surely we will be"}],"ref":"2:91","answerWord":"كُنتُم","answerSound":"audio/5333c89dec567197f954.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: Believe in that which Allah hath revealed, they say: We believe in that which was revealed unto us. And they disbelieve in that which cometh after it, though it is the truth confirming that which they possess. Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Why then slew ye the prophets of Allah aforetime, if ye are (indeed) believers?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","قَالُوا۟","نُؤْمِنُ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","عَلَيْنَا","وَيَكْفُرُونَ","بِمَا","وَرَآءَهُۥ","وَهُوَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","قُلْ","فَلِمَ","تَقْتُلُونَ","أَنۢبِيَآءَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","قَبْلُ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[28],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-94-2","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bila je","en":"she/it was"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"},{"bs":"i budi!","en":"and be!"},{"bs":"bili su","en":"they were"}],"ref":"2:94","answerWord":"كَانَتْ","answerSound":"audio/391c1ff52e62038fb715.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto them): If the abode of the Hereafter in the providence of Allah is indeed for you alone and not for others of mankind (as ye pretend), then long for death (for ye must long for death) if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِن","كَانَتْ","لَكُمُ","ٱلدَّارُ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةُ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","خَالِصَةً","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱلنَّاسِ","فَتَمَنَّوُا۟","ٱلْمَوْتَ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-57-15","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bili su","en":"they were"},{"bs":"da budu","en":"so that they (two) may be"},{"bs":"pa ste bili","en":"so you (all) were"},{"bs":"budite!","en":"(you all) be!"}],"ref":"2:57","answerWord":"كَانُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/09caa8b084290779d19c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We caused the white cloud to overshadow you and sent down on you the manna and the quails, (saying): Eat of the good things wherewith We have provided you - they wronged Us not, but they did wrong themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَظَلَّلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْغَمَامَ","وَأَنزَلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَنَّ","وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ","كُلُوا۟","مِن","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَا","رَزَقْنَٰكُمْ","وَمَا","ظَلَمُونَا","وَلَٰكِن","كَانُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-101-4-1","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"},{"bs":"budite","en":"be (you all)"},{"bs":"bila je","en":"she/it was"},{"bs":"i bio sam","en":"and I was"}],"ref":"101:4","answerWord":"يَكُونُ","answerSound":"audio/13fc74c549f17844768a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A day wherein mankind will be as thickly-scattered moths","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","يَكُونُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","كَٱلْفَرَاشِ","ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-7-173-7","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"i bili smo","en":"and we were"},{"bs":"da bude","en":"so that he/it may be"},{"bs":"budu","en":"they are"},{"bs":"da budete","en":"so that you (all) may be"}],"ref":"7:173","answerWord":"وَكُنَّا","answerSound":"audio/87ceb1343c594eedb7cf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or lest ye should say: (It is) only (that) our fathers ascribed partners to Allah of old and we were (their) seed after them. Wilt Thou destroy us on account of that which those who follow falsehood did?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["أَوْ","تَقُولُوٓا۟","إِنَّمَآ","أَشْرَكَ","ءَابَآؤُنَا","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَكُنَّا","ذُرِّيَّةً","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِهِمْ","أَفَتُهْلِكُنَا","بِمَا","فَعَلَ","ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-4-73-13","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bio sam","en":"I was"},{"bs":"i bili su","en":"and they were"},{"bs":"bila je","en":"she/it was"},{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"}],"ref":"4:73","answerWord":"كُنتُ","answerSound":"audio/cff90e9373d41fca373d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if a bounty from Allah befell you, he would surely cry, as if there had been no love between you and him: Oh, would that I had been with them, then should I have achieved a great success!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَلَئِنْ","أَصَٰبَكُمْ","فَضْلٌ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَيَقُولَنَّ","كَأَن","لَّمْ","تَكُنۢ","بَيْنَكُمْ","وَبَيْنَهُۥ","مَوَدَّةٌ","يَٰلَيْتَنِى","كُنتُ","مَعَهُمْ","فَأَفُوزَ","فَوْزًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-67-17","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"},{"bs":"i bude","en":"and he/it is"},{"bs":"budu","en":"they (two) are"},{"bs":"i bili su","en":"and they were"}],"ref":"2:67","answerWord":"أَكُونَ","answerSound":"audio/194384d96218915c8307.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Moses said unto his people: Lo! Allah commandeth you that ye sacrifice a cow, they said: Dost thou make game of us? He answered: Allah forbid that I should be among the foolish!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِۦٓ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَأْمُرُكُمْ","أَن","تَذْبَحُوا۟","بَقَرَةً","قَالُوٓا۟","أَتَتَّخِذُنَا","هُزُوًا","قَالَ","أَعُوذُ","بِٱللَّهِ","أَنْ","أَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-117-10","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"pa bude","en":"so he/it is"},{"bs":"i budu","en":"and they are"},{"bs":"bili smo","en":"we were"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"}],"ref":"2:117","answerWord":"فَيَكُونُ","answerSound":"audio/9367304712eed05b7dbf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Originator of the heavens and the earth! When He decreeth a thing, He saith unto it only: Be! and it is.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["بَدِيعُ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَإِذَا","قَضَىٰٓ","أَمْرًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَقُولُ","لَهُۥ","كُن","فَيَكُونُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-17-50-1","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"budite","en":"be (you all)"},{"bs":"da bude","en":"so that he/it may be"},{"bs":"i budem","en":"and I am"},{"bs":"budemo","en":"we are"}],"ref":"17:50","answerWord":"كُونُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/b47acc2a763417b21412.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Be ye stones or iron","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["قُلْ","كُونُوا۟","حِجَارَةً","أَوْ","حَدِيدًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-2-117-9","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"budi!","en":"be!"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I am"},{"bs":"bile su","en":"they were"},{"bs":"bili smo","en":"we were"}],"ref":"2:117","answerWord":"كُن","answerSound":"audio/57b5d531ca7e7e32950e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Originator of the heavens and the earth! When He decreeth a thing, He saith unto it only: Be! and it is.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["بَدِيعُ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَإِذَا","قَضَىٰٓ","أَمْرًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَقُولُ","لَهُۥ","كُن","فَيَكُونُ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-8-53-4","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"},{"bs":"i zaista ćemo biti","en":"and surely we will be"},{"bs":"pa neka budu","en":"so let them be"},{"bs":"i budem","en":"and I am"}],"ref":"8:53","answerWord":"يَكُ","answerSound":"audio/2ddaf6dfebdafa593139.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That is because Allah never changeth the grace He hath bestowed on any people until they first change that which is in their hearts, and (that is) because Allah is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","بِأَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَمْ","يَكُ","مُغَيِّرًا","نِّعْمَةً","أَنْعَمَهَا","عَلَىٰ","قَوْمٍ","حَتَّىٰ","يُغَيِّرُوا۟","مَا","بِأَنفُسِهِمْ","وَأَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-15-81-2","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su bili","en":"so they were"},{"bs":"pa ste bili","en":"so you (all) were"},{"bs":"pa bude","en":"so he/it is"},{"bs":"bili smo","en":"we were"}],"ref":"15:81","answerWord":"فَكَانُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2c754ddd1f588726d5c8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And we gave them Our revelations, but they were averse to them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَءَاتَيْنَٰهُمْ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","فَكَانُوا۟","عَنْهَا","مُعْرِضِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-18-79-2","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je bila","en":"so she/it was"},{"bs":"budite!","en":"(you all) be!"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo biti","en":"surely we will be"},{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"}],"ref":"18:79","answerWord":"فَكَانَتْ","answerSound":"audio/b4426d68aa262dd8a333.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for the ship, it belonged to poor people working on the river, and I wished to mar it, for there was a king behind them who is taking every ship by force.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["أَمَّا","ٱلسَّفِينَةُ","فَكَانَتْ","لِمَسَٰكِينَ","يَعْمَلُونَ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","فَأَرَدتُّ","أَنْ","أَعِيبَهَا","وَكَانَ","وَرَآءَهُم","مَّلِكٌ","يَأْخُذُ","كُلَّ","سَفِينَةٍ","غَصْبًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-4-38-12","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"bude","en":"he/it is"},{"bs":"i bili smo","en":"and we were"},{"bs":"bio sam","en":"I was"},{"bs":"bili su","en":"they were"}],"ref":"4:38","answerWord":"يَكُنِ","answerSound":"audio/43d474a911060e7898ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (also) those who spend their wealth in order to be seen of men, and believe not in Allah nor the Last Day. Whoso taketh Satan for a comrade, a bad comrade hath he.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُنفِقُونَ","أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ","رِئَآءَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَلَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","بِٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَمَن","يَكُنِ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","لَهُۥ","قَرِينًا","فَسَآءَ","قَرِينًا"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kana-6-63-14","words":["verb:kana"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćemo biti","en":"surely we will be"},{"bs":"bio sam","en":"I was"},{"bs":"bili su","en":"they (two) were"},{"bs":"i bili smo","en":"and we were"}],"ref":"6:63","answerWord":"لَنَكُونَنَّ","answerSound":"audio/acca2d938f1cc7506b0e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Who delivereth you from the darkness of the land and the sea? Ye call upon Him humbly and in secret, (saying): If we are delivered from this (fear) we truly will be of the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"biti","en":"to be"},"passage":["قُلْ","مَن","يُنَجِّيكُم","مِّن","ظُلُمَٰتِ","ٱلْبَرِّ","وَٱلْبَحْرِ","تَدْعُونَهُۥ","تَضَرُّعًا","وَخُفْيَةً","لَّئِنْ","أَنجَىٰنَا","مِنْ","هَٰذِهِۦ","لَنَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"كانَ"}},{"id":"kafara-2-6-2","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"nisu vjerovali","en":"they disbelieved"},{"bs":"ne vjerujemo","en":"we disbelieve"},{"bs":"nismo vjerovali","en":"we disbelieved"},{"bs":"nisam vjerovao","en":"I disbelieved"}],"ref":"2:6","answerWord":"كَفَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/49d39fe34c334aa631cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for the Disbelievers, Whether thou warn them or thou warn them not it is all one for them; they believe not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","سَوَآءٌ","عَلَيْهِمْ","ءَأَنذَرْتَهُمْ","أَمْ","لَمْ","تُنذِرْهُمْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-2-257-10","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"nisu vjerovali","en":"they disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovao","en":"and he/it disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovala","en":"and she/it disbelieved"},{"bs":"nisam vjerovao","en":"I disbelieved"}],"ref":"2:257","answerWord":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/89fd8f87490e9f62b160.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah is the Protecting Guardian of those who believe. He bringeth them out of darkness into light. As for those who disbelieve, their patrons are false deities. They bring them out of light into darkness. Such are rightful owners of the Fire. They will abide therein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","وَلِىُّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","يُخْرِجُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","إِلَى","ٱلنُّورِ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَوْلِيَآؤُهُمُ","ٱلطَّٰغُوتُ","يُخْرِجُونَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلنُّورِ","إِلَى","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلنَّارِ","هُمْ","فِيهَا","خَٰلِدُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-36-64-4","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"ne vjerujete (poricali ste)","en":"you disbelieved"},{"bs":"nisu vjerovali","en":"they disbelieved"},{"bs":"i niste vjerovali","en":"and you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"}],"ref":"36:64","answerWord":"تَكْفُرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/01c0c2b4a26787744511.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Burn therein this day for that ye disbelieved.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["ٱصْلَوْهَا","ٱلْيَوْمَ","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-2-121-10","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"},{"bs":"nismo vjerovali","en":"we disbelieved"},{"bs":"i niste vjerovali","en":"and you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovala","en":"and she/it disbelieved"}],"ref":"2:121","answerWord":"يَكْفُرْ","answerSound":"audio/00be96fdb5b6c1832b05.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom We have given the Scripture, who read it with the right reading, those believe in it. And whoso disbelieveth in it, those are they who are the losers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَتْلُونَهُۥ","حَقَّ","تِلَاوَتِهِۦٓ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَمَن","يَكْفُرْ","بِهِۦ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْخَٰسِرُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-14-7-7","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"bili ste nezahvalni","en":"you (all) were ungrateful"},{"bs":"nismo vjerovali","en":"we disbelieved"},{"bs":"nezahvalan sam","en":"I am ungrateful"},{"bs":"pa ne vjerujete","en":"so you (all) disbelieve"}],"ref":"14:7","answerWord":"كَفَرْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/aa7206421eb64ce2ea11.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when your Lord proclaimed: If ye give thanks, I will give you more; but if ye are thankless, lo! My punishment is dire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","تَأَذَّنَ","رَبُّكُمْ","لَئِن","شَكَرْتُمْ","لَأَزِيدَنَّكُمْ","وَلَئِن","كَفَرْتُمْ","إِنَّ","عَذَابِى","لَشَدِيدٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-2-99-6","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"},{"bs":"ne vjerujemo","en":"we disbelieve"},{"bs":"nije vjerovao","en":"he/it disbelieved"},{"bs":"da budu nezahvalni","en":"so that they may be ungrateful"}],"ref":"2:99","answerWord":"يَكْفُرُ","answerSound":"audio/f6172a4879e1fadaadcc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily We have revealed unto thee clear tokens, and only miscreants will disbelieve in them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","أَنزَلْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","ءَايَٰتٍۭ","بَيِّنَٰتٍ","وَمَا","يَكْفُرُ","بِهَآ","إِلَّا","ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-16-55-0","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"da budu nezahvalni","en":"so that they may be ungrateful"},{"bs":"i ne vjerujte!","en":"and (you all) disbelieve!"},{"bs":"niste vjerovali","en":"you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"nije vjerovao","en":"he/it disbelieved"}],"ref":"16:55","answerWord":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/cdae4b80523da5b50acb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So as to deny that which We have given them. Then enjoy life (while ye may), for ye will come to know.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","بِمَآ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمْ","فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟","فَسَوْفَ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-37-170-0","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su zanijekali","en":"yet they disbelieved"},{"bs":"nismo vjerovali","en":"we disbelieved"},{"bs":"i ne vjeruju","en":"and they disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa neka ne vjeruje","en":"so let him disbelieve"}],"ref":"37:170","answerWord":"فَكَفَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3ae20a54d6c280499467.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet (now that it is come) they disbelieve therein; but they will come to know.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["فَكَفَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَسَوْفَ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-9-66-3","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"niste vjerovali","en":"you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"neće vjerovati","en":"they will disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa ne vjerujete","en":"so you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"i nisu vjerovali","en":"and they disbelieved"}],"ref":"9:66","answerWord":"كَفَرْتُم","answerSound":"audio/fa9973411c02d09628d0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Make no excuse. Ye have disbelieved after your (confession of) belief. If We forgive a party of you, a party of you We shall punish because they have been guilty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["لَا","تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","قَدْ","كَفَرْتُم","بَعْدَ","إِيمَٰنِكُمْ","إِن","نَّعْفُ","عَن","طَآئِفَةٍ","مِّنكُمْ","نُعَذِّبْ","طَآئِفَةًۢ","بِأَنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","مُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-2-91-12","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ne vjeruju","en":"and they disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa su zanijekali","en":"yet they disbelieved"},{"bs":"pa je bila nezahvalna","en":"so she/it was ungrateful"},{"bs":"zaista ne vjerujete","en":"surely you (all) disbelieve"}],"ref":"2:91","answerWord":"وَيَكْفُرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7bb566d882bc42f60f03.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: Believe in that which Allah hath revealed, they say: We believe in that which was revealed unto us. And they disbelieve in that which cometh after it, though it is the truth confirming that which they possess. Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Why then slew ye the prophets of Allah aforetime, if ye are (indeed) believers?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","قَالُوا۟","نُؤْمِنُ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","عَلَيْنَا","وَيَكْفُرُونَ","بِمَا","وَرَآءَهُۥ","وَهُوَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","قُلْ","فَلِمَ","تَقْتُلُونَ","أَنۢبِيَآءَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","قَبْلُ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-3-72-13","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ne vjerujte!","en":"and (you all) disbelieve!"},{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"},{"bs":"niste vjerovali","en":"you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nismo vjerovali","en":"and we disbelieved"}],"ref":"3:72","answerWord":"وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/3d87abdd41667c253458.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And a party of the People of the Scripture say: Believe in that which hath been revealed unto those who believe at the opening of the day, and disbelieve at the end thereof, in order that they may return;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَقَالَت","طَّآئِفَةٌ","مِّنْ","أَهْلِ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِٱلَّذِىٓ","أُنزِلَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَجْهَ","ٱلنَّهَارِ","وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟","ءَاخِرَهُۥ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْجِعُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-3-106-9","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"zar niste vjerovali?","en":"did you (all) disbelieve?"},{"bs":"nije vjerovao","en":"he/it disbelieved"},{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"},{"bs":"ne vjeruj!","en":"disbelieve!"}],"ref":"3:106","answerWord":"أَكَفَرْتُم","answerSound":"audio/dbb719527962951fa457.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On the Day when (some) faces will be whitened and (some) faces will be blackened; and as for those whose faces have been blackened, it will be said unto them: Disbelieved ye after your (profession of) belief? Then taste the punishment for that ye disbelieved.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","تَبْيَضُّ","وُجُوهٌ","وَتَسْوَدُّ","وُجُوهٌ","فَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْوَدَّتْ","وُجُوهُهُمْ","أَكَفَرْتُم","بَعْدَ","إِيمَٰنِكُمْ","فَذُوقُوا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-4-150-14","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"i ne vjerujemo","en":"and we disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa neka ne vjeruje","en":"so let him disbelieve"},{"bs":"i ne vjerujete","en":"and you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovao","en":"and he/it disbelieved"}],"ref":"4:150","answerWord":"وَنَكْفُرُ","answerSound":"audio/cd111b6379b4d425d1cf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who disbelieve in Allah and His messengers, and seek to make distinction between Allah and His messengers, and say: We believe in some and disbelieve in others, and seek to choose a way in between;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْفُرُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرُسُلِهِۦ","وَيُرِيدُونَ","أَن","يُفَرِّقُوا۟","بَيْنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَرُسُلِهِۦ","وَيَقُولُونَ","نُؤْمِنُ","بِبَعْضٍ","وَنَكْفُرُ","بِبَعْضٍ","وَيُرِيدُونَ","أَن","يَتَّخِذُوا۟","بَيْنَ","ذَٰلِكَ","سَبِيلًا"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-14-8-3","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"nezahvalni ste","en":"you (all) are ungrateful"},{"bs":"i ne vjerujte!","en":"and (you all) disbelieve!"},{"bs":"pa su zanijekali","en":"yet they disbelieved"},{"bs":"ne vjeruje","en":"he/it disbelieves"}],"ref":"14:8","answerWord":"تَكْفُرُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/2fefb99e62d2ea77ecaf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Moses said: Though ye and all who are in the earth prove thankless, lo! Allah verily is Absolute, Owner of Praise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","مُوسَىٰٓ","إِن","تَكْفُرُوٓا۟","أَنتُمْ","وَمَن","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","جَمِيعًا","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَغَنِىٌّ","حَمِيدٌ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-16-112-13","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je bila nezahvalna","en":"so she/it was ungrateful"},{"bs":"ne vjeruj!","en":"disbelieve!"},{"bs":"zaista ne vjerujete","en":"surely you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa su zanijekali","en":"yet they disbelieved"}],"ref":"16:112","answerWord":"فَكَفَرَتْ","answerSound":"audio/4920c7c847d2751160d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah coineth a similitude: a township that dwelt secure and well content, its provision coming to it in abundance from every side, but it disbelieved in Allah's favours, so Allah made it experience the garb of dearth and fear because of what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَضَرَبَ","ٱللَّهُ","مَثَلًا","قَرْيَةً","كَانَتْ","ءَامِنَةً","مُّطْمَئِنَّةً","يَأْتِيهَا","رِزْقُهَا","رَغَدًا","مِّن","كُلِّ","مَكَانٍ","فَكَفَرَتْ","بِأَنْعُمِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَأَذَٰقَهَا","ٱللَّهُ","لِبَاسَ","ٱلْجُوعِ","وَٱلْخَوْفِ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-18-29-9","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa neka ne vjeruje","en":"so let him disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa ne vjerujete","en":"so you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa su zanijekali","en":"yet they disbelieved"},{"bs":"nisam vjerovao","en":"I disbelieved"}],"ref":"18:29","answerWord":"فَلْيَكْفُرْ","answerSound":"audio/bdac724e36aeec9dbb42.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: (It is) the truth from the Lord of you (all). Then whosoever will, let him believe, and whosoever will, let him disbelieve. Lo! We have prepared for disbelievers Fire. Its tent encloseth them. If they ask for showers, they will be showered with water like to molten lead which burneth the faces. Calamitous the drink and ill the resting-place!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["وَقُلِ","ٱلْحَقُّ","مِن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَمَن","شَآءَ","فَلْيُؤْمِن","وَمَن","شَآءَ","فَلْيَكْفُرْ","إِنَّآ","أَعْتَدْنَا","لِلظَّٰلِمِينَ","نَارًا","أَحَاطَ","بِهِمْ","سُرَادِقُهَا","وَإِن","يَسْتَغِيثُوا۟","يُغَاثُوا۟","بِمَآءٍ","كَٱلْمُهْلِ","يَشْوِى","ٱلْوُجُوهَ","بِئْسَ","ٱلشَّرَابُ","وَسَآءَتْ","مُرْتَفَقًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-18-37-5","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"zar nisi vjerovao?","en":"did you disbelieve?"},{"bs":"ne vjerujete (poricali ste)","en":"you disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovala","en":"and she/it disbelieved"},{"bs":"i ne vjerujemo","en":"and we disbelieve"}],"ref":"18:37","answerWord":"أَكَفَرْتَ","answerSound":"audio/0392af8feb2523f4544c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"His comrade, when he (thus) spake with him, exclaimed: Disbelievest thou in Him Who created thee of dust, then of a drop (of seed), and then fashioned thee a man?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَهُۥ","صَاحِبُهُۥ","وَهُوَ","يُحَاوِرُهُۥٓ","أَكَفَرْتَ","بِٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَكَ","مِن","تُرَابٍ","ثُمَّ","مِن","نُّطْفَةٍ","ثُمَّ","سَوَّىٰكَ","رَجُلًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-19-82-1","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"neće vjerovati","en":"they will disbelieve"},{"bs":"pa ne vjerujete","en":"so you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"i niste vjerovali","en":"and you (all) disbelieved"},{"bs":"i nisu vjerovali","en":"and they disbelieved"}],"ref":"19:82","answerWord":"سَيَكْفُرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/49f44cdbbdaa7fe7cb4e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but they will deny their worship of them, and become opponents unto them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["كَلَّا","سَيَكْفُرُونَ","بِعِبَادَتِهِمْ","وَيَكُونُونَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","ضِدًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-40-10-14","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ne vjerujete","en":"so you (all) disbelieve"},{"bs":"nisu vjerovali","en":"they disbelieved"},{"bs":"da budu nezahvalni","en":"so that they may be ungrateful"},{"bs":"i nije vjerovala","en":"and she/it disbelieved"}],"ref":"40:10","answerWord":"فَتَكْفُرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7093cc76ff719a586a2d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! (on that day) those who disbelieve are informed by proclamation: Verily Allah's abhorrence is more terrible than your abhorrence one of another, when ye were called unto the faith but did refuse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","يُنَادَوْنَ","لَمَقْتُ","ٱللَّهِ","أَكْبَرُ","مِن","مَّقْتِكُمْ","أَنفُسَكُمْ","إِذْ","تُدْعَوْنَ","إِلَى","ٱلْإِيمَٰنِ","فَتَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"kafara-40-42-1","words":["verb:kafara"],"options":[{"bs":"da ne vjerujem","en":"so that I may disbelieve"},{"bs":"bili ste nezahvalni","en":"you (all) were ungrateful"},{"bs":"da budu nezahvalni","en":"so that they may be ungrateful"},{"bs":"nisu vjerovali","en":"they disbelieved"}],"ref":"40:42","answerWord":"لِأَكْفُرَ","answerSound":"audio/0487dd1957cace1bf0b7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye call me to disbelieve in Allah and ascribe unto Him as partners that whereof I have no knowledge, while I call you unto the Mighty, the Forgiver.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ne vjerovati, poricati","en":"to disbelieve"},"passage":["تَدْعُونَنِى","لِأَكْفُرَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَأُشْرِكَ","بِهِۦ","مَا","لَيْسَ","لِى","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","وَأَنَا۠","أَدْعُوكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلْغَفَّٰرِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَفَرَ"}},{"id":"katama-2-33-21","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"skrivate","en":"you (all) conceal"},{"bs":"zaista skrivaju","en":"surely they conceal"},{"bs":"skrivate je","en":"you (all) conceal it"},{"bs":"skriva ga","en":"he/it conceals it"}],"ref":"2:33","answerWord":"تَكْتُمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7f70299918066e8db076.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Adam! Inform them of their names, and when he had informed them of their names, He said: Did I not tell you that I know the secret of the heavens and the earth? And I know that which ye disclose and which ye hide.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰٓـَٔادَمُ","أَنۢبِئْهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","فَلَمَّآ","أَنۢبَأَهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","قَالَ","أَلَمْ","أَقُل","لَّكُمْ","إِنِّىٓ","أَعْلَمُ","غَيْبَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَأَعْلَمُ","مَا","تُبْدُونَ","وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-2-159-2","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"skriva ga","en":"he/it conceals it"},{"bs":"skrivate","en":"you (all) conceal"},{"bs":"skriva","en":"he/it conceals"}],"ref":"2:159","answerWord":"يَكْتُمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/e8740f2ac3f12e77ea7c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who hide the proofs and the guidance which We revealed, after We had made it clear to mankind in the Scripture: such are accursed of Allah and accursed of those who have the power to curse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","أَنزَلْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلْهُدَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","بَيَّنَّٰهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","فِى","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّٰعِنُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-2-42-4","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"i prikrivate","en":"and conceal"},{"bs":"skriva ga","en":"he/it conceals it"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"skrivate je","en":"you (all) conceal it"}],"ref":"2:42","answerWord":"وَتَكْتُمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/17d0c14b7d7702331444.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Confound not truth with falsehood, nor knowingly conceal the truth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَلْبِسُوا۟","ٱلْحَقَّ","بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ","وَتَكْتُمُوا۟","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-2-140-20","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"sakrio je","en":"he/it concealed"},{"bs":"skriva ga","en":"he/it conceals it"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"skriva","en":"he/it conceals"}],"ref":"2:140","answerWord":"كَتَمَ","answerSound":"audio/ea3fe6092b238be72a6c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or say ye that Abraham, and Ishmael, and Isaac, and Jacob, and the tribes were Jews or Christians? Say: Do ye know best, or doth Allah? And who is more unjust than he who hideth a testimony which he hath received from Allah? Allah is not unaware of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["أَمْ","تَقُولُونَ","إِنَّ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ","وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ","وَإِسْحَٰقَ","وَيَعْقُوبَ","وَٱلْأَسْبَاطَ","كَانُوا۟","هُودًا","أَوْ","نَصَٰرَىٰ","قُلْ","ءَأَنتُمْ","أَعْلَمُ","أَمِ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَنْ","أَظْلَمُ","مِمَّن","كَتَمَ","شَهَٰدَةً","عِندَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَا","ٱللَّهُ","بِغَٰفِلٍ","عَمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-2-146-10","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista skrivaju","en":"surely they conceal"},{"bs":"sakrio je","en":"he/it concealed"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"i skrivate","en":"and you (all) conceal"}],"ref":"2:146","answerWord":"لَيَكْتُمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/51f2774ef88b55ec6288.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom We gave the Scripture recognise (this revelation) as they recognise their sons. But lo! a party of them knowingly conceal the truth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَعْرِفُونَهُۥ","كَمَا","يَعْرِفُونَ","أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","وَإِنَّ","فَرِيقًا","مِّنْهُمْ","لَيَكْتُمُونَ","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَهُمْ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-3-71-6","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"i skrivate","en":"and you (all) conceal"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"zaista skrivaju","en":"surely they conceal"},{"bs":"skrivate je","en":"you (all) conceal it"}],"ref":"3:71","answerWord":"وَتَكْتُمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/6cb8c4d99948cbaf3097.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O People of the Scripture! Why confound ye truth with falsehood and knowingly conceal the truth?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَهْلَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لِمَ","تَلْبِسُونَ","ٱلْحَقَّ","بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ","وَتَكْتُمُونَ","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-3-187-10","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"skrivate je","en":"you (all) conceal it"},{"bs":"skriva ga","en":"he/it conceals it"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"},{"bs":"skrivate","en":"you (all) conceal"}],"ref":"3:187","answerWord":"تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/53cb6f7d2efcc8e473ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Allah laid a charge on those who had received the Scripture (He said): Ye are to expound it to mankind and not to hide it. But they flung it behind their backs and bought thereby a little gain. Verily evil is that which they have gained thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِيثَٰقَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ","لِلنَّاسِ","وَلَا","تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ","فَنَبَذُوهُ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِهِمْ","وَٱشْتَرَوْا۟","بِهِۦ","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","فَبِئْسَ","مَا","يَشْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"katama-4-37-5","words":["verb:katama"],"options":[{"bs":"i skrivaju","en":"and they conceal"},{"bs":"sakrio je","en":"he/it concealed"},{"bs":"i prikrivate","en":"and conceal"},{"bs":"skrivaju","en":"they conceal"}],"ref":"4:37","answerWord":"وَيَكْتُمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/75a85c58fb7abf901887.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who hoard their wealth and enjoin avarice on others, and hide that which Allah hath bestowed upon them of His bounty. For disbelievers We prepare a shameful doom;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sakriti, prešutjeti","en":"to conceal, to hide"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَبْخَلُونَ","وَيَأْمُرُونَ","ٱلنَّاسَ","بِٱلْبُخْلِ","وَيَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","ءَاتَىٰهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَأَعْتَدْنَا","لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ","عَذَابًا","مُّهِينًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَمَ"}},{"id":"naqasa-13-41-5","words":["verb:naqasa"],"options":[{"bs":"umanjujemo je","en":"we decrease it"},{"bs":"biva umanjen","en":"he/it is decreased"},{"bs":"smanji","en":"reduce"},{"bs":"umanjujete","en":"you (all) diminish"}],"ref":"13:41","answerWord":"نَنقُصُهَا","answerSound":"audio/5553edc084b3651bcc45.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"See they not how we aim to the land, reducing it of its outlying parts? (When) Allah doometh there is none that can postpone His doom, and He is swift at reckoning.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smanjiti se, umanjiti","en":"to decrease, to reduce"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّا","نَأْتِى","ٱلْأَرْضَ","نَنقُصُهَا","مِنْ","أَطْرَافِهَا","وَٱللَّهُ","يَحْكُمُ","لَا","مُعَقِّبَ","لِحُكْمِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","سَرِيعُ","ٱلْحِسَابِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"نَقَصَ"}},{"id":"naqasa-9-4-7","words":["verb:naqasa"],"options":[{"bs":"umanjuju vas","en":"they decrease you (all)"},{"bs":"umanjuje","en":"diminishes"},{"bs":"umanjujemo je","en":"we decrease it"},{"bs":"biva umanjen","en":"he/it is decreased"}],"ref":"9:4","answerWord":"يَنقُصُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a674b56766ff67a8a462.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Excepting those of the idolaters with whom ye (Muslims) have a treaty, and who have since abated nothing of your right nor have supported anyone against you. (As for these), fulfil their treaty to them till their term. Lo! Allah loveth those who keep their duty (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smanjiti se, umanjiti","en":"to decrease, to reduce"},"passage":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","عَٰهَدتُّم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَنقُصُوكُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","وَلَمْ","يُظَٰهِرُوا۟","عَلَيْكُمْ","أَحَدًا","فَأَتِمُّوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِمْ","عَهْدَهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","مُدَّتِهِمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نَقَصَ"}},{"id":"naqasa-11-84-14","words":["verb:naqasa"],"options":[{"bs":"umanjujete","en":"you (all) diminish"},{"bs":"umanjuju vas","en":"they decrease you (all)"},{"bs":"umanjuje","en":"diminishes"},{"bs":"umanjujemo je","en":"we decrease it"}],"ref":"11:84","answerWord":"تَنقُصُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/fd693959666aff20da35.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And unto Midian (We sent) their brother Shu'eyb. He said: O my people! Serve Allah. Ye have no other Allah save Him! And give not short measure and short weight. Lo! I see you well-to-do, and lo! I fear for you the doom of a besetting Day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smanjiti se, umanjiti","en":"to decrease, to reduce"},"passage":["وَإِلَىٰ","مَدْيَنَ","أَخَاهُمْ","شُعَيْبًا","قَالَ","يَٰقَوْمِ","ٱعْبُدُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّنْ","إِلَٰهٍ","غَيْرُهُۥ","وَلَا","تَنقُصُوا۟","ٱلْمِكْيَالَ","وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","إِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰكُم","بِخَيْرٍ","وَإِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","عَذَابَ","يَوْمٍ","مُّحِيطٍ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"نَقَصَ"}},{"id":"naqasa-73-3-2","words":["verb:naqasa"],"options":[{"bs":"smanji","en":"reduce"},{"bs":"biva umanjen","en":"he/it is decreased"},{"bs":"umanjuju vas","en":"they decrease you (all)"},{"bs":"umanjujemo je","en":"we decrease it"}],"ref":"73:3","answerWord":"ٱنقُصْ","answerSound":"audio/800e4e7de9879fa05221.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A half thereof, or abate a little thereof","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"smanjiti se, umanjiti","en":"to decrease, to reduce"},"passage":["نِّصْفَهُۥٓ","أَوِ","ٱنقُصْ","مِنْهُ","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَقَصَ"}}]